    (lambda ((u!8 Int)(u!9 Int)(u!10 Int)(u!12 Int)(u!13 Int)(u!15 Int)(u!16 Int)(u!18 Int)(u!19 Int)(u!21 Int)(u!22 Int)(u!23 Int)(f!0!6 Int)(b_fj!3!14 Int)(a_fi!4!17 Int)(a_fh!5!20 Int)(b_fk!2!11 Int)(UNIVERALSET!1!7 Int))
